ds, reviews, racing, and the machines that keep us coming back.</p><a class="button button-light" href="${esc(site.socials.YouTube)}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Subscribe on YouTube ↗</a></div><div class="video-placeholder"><span class="play-icon">▶</span><strong>Latest videos</strong><span>Add YouTube video IDs in the site settings to embed videos here.</span></div></div></section><section class="category-band wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">FIND YOUR NEXT READ</p><h2>Explore the garage<span class="red-dot">.</span></h2></div></div><div class="category-grid">${site.categories.map((c,i)=>`<a href="/category/${slugify(c)}/" class="category-tile"><span>0${i+1}</span><strong>${esc(c)}</strong><b>↗</b></a>`).join('')}</div></section><section class="newsletter-section" id="newsletter"><div class="wrap newsletter-inner"><div><p class="eyebrow">JOIN THE GRID</p><h2>Good stories. Great machines.<br>Straight to your inbox.</h2><p>Get the best of 919Racing, from breaking news to builds worth bookmarking.</p></div><form class="newsletter-form" id="newsletter-form"><label for="newsletter-email">Your email address</label><div class="newsletter-field"><input id="newsletter-email" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required><button type="submit">Keep me posted ↗</button></div><small id="newsletter-message">Newsletter provider not connected yet. This form is a non-collecting placeholder until you choose a provider.</small></form></div></section></main>`;
